{"pageid": 969, "title": "Gold Mask", "revid": 2246, "categories": ["Gold Masks", "Lore", "Masks", "Order of St. George"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5d/GoldMask.png/revision/latest?cb=20241130215921\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Gold Mask of .\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5d/GoldMask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241130215921\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"123\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"GoldMask.png\" data-image-key=\"GoldMask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:GoldMask.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Gold Mask of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;padding:10px 10px;\">“\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:4px 10px;\"><i>If the central tenet of the Order of St. George is that one most become a monster to hunt monsters, it followed that only one who has killed dragons could take the title of Dragon.</i>\n</td>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;padding:10px 10px;\">”\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"line-height:1em;text-align: right\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">&#8212; <a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">The Book of Slaughter</a></cite></div><i></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>The Dragons</b> of the Order of St. George, also known as <b>Gold Masks,</b> are the leaders of each House of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>. Wearing a metallic golden mask, shaped like animalistic fangs, the Dragons are appointed by Council and serve <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Dragon King (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0RyYWdvbl9LaW5nP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">The Dragon King</span> as they control their houses and herald communication between others.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Gold Masks are the leaders of each House. They are given great respect, and final say in every major decision of the House. In the earlier days of the Order, only <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Mask\" title=\"Emerald Mask\">Emerald Masks</a> could become Dragons, with the belief that only someone who slayed a dragon could take that title for themselves. With the decrease of <a href=\"/wiki/Dracotypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dracotypes\">Dracotypes</a> in the wild, and thus a decrease of Emerald Masks, rules have loosened. In Houses without Emerald Masks, the council will present a candidate to <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Great House of St. George (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0dyZWF0X0hvdXNlX29mX1N0Ll9HZW9yZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">The Great House</span>, who will approve or disprove of their selection. Once the role is granted, they are given their title.\n</p><p>The Dragon of the Great House is known as <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Dragon King (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0RyYWdvbl9LaW5nP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">The Dragon King</span>, and is the most respected person in the Order.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Dragons\">Known Dragons</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Boucher\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQm91Y2hlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">House of Boucher</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Vionette Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVmlvbmV0dGVfQm91Y2hlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Vionette Boucher</span> <small><i>(current)</i></small></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Cassius Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2Fzc2l1c19Cb3VjaGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Cassius Boucher</span> †</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Slaughter\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Old_Dragon\" title=\"The Old Dragon\">The Old Dragon</a></li></ul>\n<p>Currently, <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a> is considered the next-in-line to take over as Dragon following the Old Dragon's death.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC21&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC21-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:128px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"GoldMask-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:126px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:GoldMask.png\" title=\"GoldMask.png (1.91 MB)\" style=\"height:126px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5d/GoldMask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241130215921\" title=\"GoldMask.png (1.91 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"126\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"GoldMask.png\" data-image-key=\"GoldMask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"GoldMask.png (1.91 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"126\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"GoldMask.png\" data-image-key=\"GoldMask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5d/GoldMask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241130215921\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">Book of Slaughter</a>,</i> vol. #1, <a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">issue no.1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2022.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC21-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC21_2-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Road_to_Tribulation_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The Road to Tribulation (comic arc)\">vol. #5</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_21\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 21\">issue no. 21</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2022.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></small></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:36+00:00"}